{"id":"concept-语言游戏","slug":"语言游戏","entityType":"concept","name":"语言游戏","originalTerms":["Sprachspiel","language-game"],"summary":"语言游戏是维特根斯坦用来观察语言多样用途的概念：命名、请求、计数、玩笑、祈祷等活动各有规则和训练。词的意义要在这些使用中看，而不先假定一种共同本质。","senses":[{"traditionId":"tradition-分析哲学","label":"语言游戏","explanation":"语言游戏把说话同具体行动连在一起。它不是任意游戏，也不表示语言没有标准；规则、回应和训练构成理解某种说法的条件。","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-wittgenstein-investigations-anscombe","locator":"§§7, 19, 23, 43","claim":"支持语言游戏与意义即使用的原典定位。"}]}],"personIds":["wittgenstein"],"workIds":["philosophical-investigations"],"traditionIds":["tradition-分析哲学"],"sourceIds":["src-wittgenstein","src-wittgenstein-investigations-anscombe"],"citations":[{"sourceId":"src-wittgenstein","locator":"Sections 3.2–3.4","claim":"支持语言游戏、使用和家族相似的解释。"}],"contentTier":"standard","editorialStatus":"published","version":2,"editedBy":"思想星图编辑组","reviewedBy":"source-structure-review/journey-batch-v1","lastReviewedAt":"2026-08-05","notes":"不把语言游戏解释为语言完全任意。"}
